<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>System Behavior &amp; Validation</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Schedule and Frequency</strong>: Admin must select the campaign'=
s delivery method, frequency, and expiration date before proceeding.</p></l=
i>
<li>
<p><strong>Test Email</strong>: The system allows the Admin to verify the c=
ampaign configuration via a test email before sending the actual campaign.<=
/p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Validation</strong>: Fields like <strong>Campaign Frequency</str=
ong> and <strong>First Batch Delivery</strong> are validated to ensure corr=
ect data input.</p></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Security Handling</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Access Control</strong>: Only authorized users (admins) can conf=
igure campaign settings and schedule delivery.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Data Security</strong>: All campaign schedule and configuration =
data are securely stored.</p></li>
</ul>
